==Battleground==
*1 [[Chun-Li (Enemy)|Chun-Li]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Guile (Enemy)|Guile]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Blanka (Enemy)|Blanka]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Dhalsim (Enemy)|Dhalsim]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 25 seconds<sup>750f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*7 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 31.67 seconds<sup>950f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 108.33 seconds<sup>3,250f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 40~50 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use ranged units such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] or its [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|crazed counterpart]] to effectively outrange Chun-Li and Dhalsim. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] can also help a lot here, in either 2nd or 3rd form. Also try to avoid melee units as much as possible as they won't be of too much use here.

